From: wayondroid
Origin: own

A gralloc service on a second kumquat socket for an Android guest:
ALLOC makes a context-less 3D resource (a gfxstream ColorBuffer) with a
shared CPU backing and hands out a lifetime socket; the resource is
freed when every guest copy of it is closed. TRANSFER copies between
the backing and the ColorBuffer for CPU locks.

